<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Nov trade surplus 12.5 billion crowns.</title>
<headline>Swedish Nov trade surplus 12.5 billion crowns.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's November trade surplus was 12.5 billion crowns, Statistics Sweden said on Friday.  </p>
<p>SWEDISH TRADE BALANCE     Nov 96     Oct 96     Nov 95</p>
<p>    Exports			 51.7	 53.7	 52.0</p>
<p>    Imports			 39.2	 41.9	 41.4</p>
<p>    Trade balance		 +12.5	+11.8	+10.6</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of crowns. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a 11.2 billion crown surplus. -- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom, 46-8-700-1006</p>
</text>
